# Every text file is checked out with LF line endings, on every system.
#
# What awkit installs into a project (the kit's files, the project skeleton)
# is embedded into the binary as it is in the working tree. With the line
# endings of the platform, a checkout on Windows turned those files into CRLF,
# and a build from it wrote CRLF files into every project it set up.
* text=auto eol=lf
